# Discovery gate

- When creating or editing implementation plans, reference the discovery spec in the plan header (`docs/discovery/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>.md`).
- Security assumptions (data sensitivity, auth, compliance) must be documented in the discovery spec before implementation.
- Design decisions (purpose, tone, differentiation) must be documented before frontend work.
- Do not scaffold or implement substantial features without a discovery spec or explicit user confirmation to skip discovery.
